# Baked into `npm run electron:build` (and any plain `vite build`) via
# vite.config.ts's loadEnv() — this is what makes a freshly-installed
# desktop app try Azure automatically with no manual `export` step.
#
# collabService.probeAzureReachability() checks this URL is actually
# reachable at app startup and falls back to the local bundled server
# (http://localhost:3010) if it isn't — see collabService.ts.
#
# To point a build at a different ACA1 deployment (or to ship a purely
# local-only build), edit or delete this line. Deleting it (or leaving it
# blank) makes the build behave exactly like before: local-only, same as
# `npm run dev`.
VITE_ACA1_URL=https://as-eq-gantt-api.livelyground-11135bce.japaneast.azurecontainerapps.io
